WEBVTT

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.710
The Deep Floors?

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.830
It's a scary place, I guess.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.500
Words don't really do it justice.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:15.380
But it sinks in once you get there.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:21.420
If you ever make it to the Deep Floors,
you'll know what I mean.

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:28.380
That growling noise...

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.080
The monster...

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.830
It's coming for us.

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:45.540
A great disaster cometh.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:51.210
Do not approach it, for it is the embodiment of ruin.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:55.880
Do not touch it, for it is the oracle of death.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:01.790
The cage of despair shall become a coffin,
and thou shalt suffer.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:03.670
Do not forget:

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:09.000
The light thou seekest is the life-giving Sun,
for there is no other.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:12.710
Gather the pieces, offer up the flame,

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:15.330
and pray for the great daystar's golden rays.

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:17.670
Take heed.

00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:20.290
It is a banquet of tragedy.

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:35.580
Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:55.040
Amphisbaena

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:55.040
A Song of Despair

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.330
It really is the Floor Boss...

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:34.250
I can't breathe...

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:37.750
Cover your mouth, or else the heat will burn your throat!

00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:40.920
It's like an oven in here...

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:43.330
That must've been its Blue Napalm attack.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.170
Let's fall back for now.

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:48.540
What?!

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:51.330
But Master Bell's still on the 27th Floor!

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:52.830
We don't have much of a choice!

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.330
Let's regroup and then worry about him.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.170
Unless you wanna die, I suggest you hurry!

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:04.000
Is this a part of my premonition? Or...?

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:05.540
I'm not sure...

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:08.250
I'm not sure, but something feels wrong...

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:17.920
Keep moving!

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.880
Run for the exit like your life depends on it!

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:24.250
Split up!

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:25.540
If it touches you, you're a goner!

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:28.580
Lady Haruhime!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.500
Master Ouka!

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:35.250
Hurry!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:39.330
Damn, it melted that shield like it was nothing...

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:13.330
What are you talking about, Ouranos?!

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:17.750
Amphisbaena isn't supposed
to spawn for another two weeks!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.630
And yet, it already has.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:25.830
The Dungeon has chosen to ignore
the interval and send forth a Monster Rex.

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:31.460
The Juggernaut's appearance
was an Irregular in and of itself...

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:33.670
What the hell's going on?!

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:37.290
Are they... Is the Hestia Family alive?!

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:41.960
That's not the only Irregular thing about it.

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:45.830
The Juggernaut... has moved.

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.210
Impossible!

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:52.540
It might be bloodthirsty, but given the implications
of its birth, it's unlikely to migrate to a different floor!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.790
The White Palace.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:01.420
I suspect that the Juggernaut
is headed for the Deep Floors.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:04.290
What's happening...?

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:12.290
At any rate, if we want to get a handle on the situation,
we should send in reinforcements.

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:15.750
Going through the proper channels will take too long!

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:18.710
We'll do everything we can...

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:23.960
...even if it is all for naught.

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:32.040
That sound... It's gotta be...

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.750
That monster's going to show up any minute...

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.830
No... Is it still following his orders...?

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.460
My arm... It hurts just to breathe.

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:51.420
The Goliath Scarf seems to have kept it intact, but...

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:53.420
...my bones are a shattered mess.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:56.040
Miss Ryu's injured pretty badly, too...

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:57.670
We don't stand a chance this time.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:01.290
If it attacks us now, it'll kill us in an instant!

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:05.710
I've got to get out of here...

00:07:07.580 --> 00:07:13.170
But I don't know what kind of monsters
might be lurking beyond that door...

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:17.420
So then, should I... stay here and fight?

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:20.130
Take on that monster, while I'm broken and bleeding?

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.710
But if it corners us in a narrow passageway...

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:28.080
It's no use... I can't think straight!

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.210
The darkness is suffocating!

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:34.460
Is this what the Deep Floors do to people?

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:38.000
You're kidding me...

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:40.380
Oh no...

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:42.460
Our escape route...

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:48.000
The eastern passage, too...

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:54.920
It locked us in...

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.250
I was a fool.

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:11.580
I should've known there was no escaping my dreams...

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:13.380
No escaping the disaster.

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:17.920
This is the "cage of despair."

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:23.380
A Floor Boss that shouldn't
have spawned, a prison cell...

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:27.920
If I didn't know any better,
I'd say the Dungeon wants us dead.

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:31.500
Hard to say. But if it does, then...

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:35.580
Prepare for the worst!

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:38.540
Running isn't an option anymore. We have to fight!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:44.830
Figured that wouldn't work...

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:46.460
Can't blame 'em.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:49.880
When you're staring down the barrel of an Irregular,
it ain't easy to think positive...

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:02.290
You guys okay?!

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:07.500
We don't have the strength or the morale to survive.

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:10.540
It doesn't matter how much the party's improved.

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:13.750
Under circumstances like these,
of course they're gonna lose the will to fight...

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:18.170
If only Bell Cranel were here...

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:23.290
Get your shit together, Aisha Belka!

00:09:23.670 --> 00:09:26.830
When did you turn into
a weak little girl who relies on men?!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.250
Still, these chumps look up
to Bell Cranel like he's a hero...

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:36.000
It's your first time, ain't it, Lil Squeak?

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.000
Going on an adventure without Bell.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:41.290
"We can't fight without our tough guy."

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:43.210
"We can't fight without our hero."

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:44.630
Says who?!

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:47.670
That's not the kind of people us adventurers are, is it?!

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.830
"They can't do anything without Bell."

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:53.500
We can't have a reputation like that!
Makes us all look bad!

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:56.630
Am I wrong? I'm right, aren't I?!

00:09:57.830 --> 00:10:00.330
So let's make Bell proud of us for a change.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:03.880
We'll tell him how we took down
a Floor Boss on our own!

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:06.960
Uh, obviously!

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:12.580
From here on out, Lili intends to stand at his side
as a partner in our adventures! An equal!

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:13.790
Same here!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.080
We won't play second fiddle to Bell Cranel!

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:17.290
Right, Chigusa?!

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:18.040
Yeah!

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:22.710
Me neither! I'll be too ashamed to face Master Bell
if I do not find the strength to fight!

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:24.380
A-agreed...!

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:26.830
I don't want him to leave me behind!

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:29.330
I don't want to go back to a life of waiting around!

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:32.330
Jeez, you guys... Oversimplifying much?

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:34.670
But I guess you're right. That's why we're adventurers.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:38.750
Box us in and we'll slash our way out!

00:10:39.080 --> 00:10:40.040
Daphne...

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:42.210
Not bad, Ignis.

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:45.130
I've fought this ugly lizard once or twice myself!

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:48.080
We might not be strong enough to kill it, but...

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.500
...let's go kick some ass!

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:52.500
Yeah!
Hell yeah!

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:00.210
Hiyo!

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:09.330
There, frozen solid! Have at it!

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:14.420
Good thinking!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:36.540
The most common way to defeat Amphisbaena
is by attacking it in an area with accessible footholds!

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.750
It's my turn! Now watch closely!

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.330
Come forth, champion of valor!

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:50.250
Ravenous blade, thy name is Hippolyta!

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:55.130
Hell Kaios!

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:01.130
Her magic...!

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:02.500
It got neutralized?!

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:09.210
That was Amphisbaena's crimson Mist attack!

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:10.500
You saw for yourself...

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:12.580
It scatters any magic it comes into contact with!

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:20.040
Which means... if we're gonna dust this thing,
we've gotta hit it from up close!

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:25.630
We might be able to pierce through the fog if we keep
blasting it with magic, but it's not worth the trouble!

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:28.580
It's not possible for us anyway!

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:32.000
Guess these are mostly useless, too...

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:38.000
It won't be long until the
cage of despair becomes a coffin...

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:41.080
And there's nothing we can do to stop it...

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:45.920
Uchide no Kozuchi!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:47.880
Dance!

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:52.420
We need to raise our stats so it won't kill us in one blow!

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:58.500
Cast Level Boost on Master Welf, Master Ouka,
Lady Mikoto, and Lady Daphne!

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:09.500
Are you alright, Lady Haruhime?!

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:12.130
Don't worry, I'll be fine...

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:16.420
I should be able to avoid Mind Down
so long as I only use four tails at most.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.580
My apologies, Lady Chigusa.

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:22.170
For now, you'll have to play support to the vanguard!

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:31.540
Sorry, Chigusa...

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.750
I understand. I don't mind waiting my turn!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.380
Heed the rays in the sky above.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:46.250
Bloom, my armor of laurel...
so that all may retreat from thee.

00:13:46.710 --> 00:13:47.710
Raumure!

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:51.920
Daphne, that spell...

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.210
It reminds me of Master Apollon.
That's why I never liked to use it.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.750
But now's not the time to be a scrooge, is it?

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.540
Handle the healing, will ya?

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:02.790
D-Daphne...!

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:07.630
It's hopeless...

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:11.960
None can escape... from the despair...

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:17.960
Ryu's a suspect in a murder investigation?!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:20.170
This was delivered to me from the 18th Floor.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.250
It's a letter from our supporter.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:26.130
Sounds like Miss Elf fled into the Dungeon,
and they've joined the manhunt.

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:28.630
They're reserving judgment until they hear her side.

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:32.920
It's a meow-stake! A big softie like Ryu wouldn't
hurt a fly, much less meowrder someone!

00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:37.380
Anya's right! Ryu's not out there committing
homeowcide, not even on her days off!

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:39.670
Yeah, I didn't think so.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:42.920
It's just... I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:47.500
In fact, I've been asked to have
reinforcements ready just in case.

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:52.290
Maybe I'm being paranoid, but I'd rather play it safe.

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:55.540
I was hoping you might lend Bell and the others a hand.

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.630
I was right... We have to move.

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:03.710
We've gotta run...

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.540
As far away as we possibly can...

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:10.130
There'll be more monsters past this tunnel.

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:13.170
But if we don't get out of here now–

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:36.790
Breath incoming!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:42.210
Dammit, we're losing footholds!

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.880
A Floor Boss dragon...

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.920
I knew it would be powerful, but...

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:47.170
...it doesn't have a weak spot!

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:49.920
If it doesn't have one, then we'll MAKE one!

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:56.250
Too shallow!

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:56.960
That's a hit!

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:58.380
Let's get in there!

00:15:58.380 --> 00:15:58.880
Right!

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:08.880
It dove underwater?!

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:09.830
Seriously?!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:17.790
Brace yourselves.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:33.830
Blue Napalm and Mist...

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.330
Two heads and no blind spots...

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:38.630
AND it can swim underwater...

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:44.210
My friends are fighting their absolute hardest to survive,
and I can't do anything to help...

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:48.830
What kind of a commander lets
her team face danger alone?!

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:50.710
What good am–

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:51.710
Liliruca!

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:52.920
Stay focused!

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:56.710
Great leaders don't beat themselves up
over things they can't control!

00:16:57.210 --> 00:17:00.710
They assess the issue calmly and
then decide how to maneuver the situation!

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:02.170
I'm heading to the front line!

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:03.920
The rest is up to you, Commander!

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.130
"Maneuver the situation..."

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:12.540
Lady Mikoto!

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:14.330
Time to switch positions!

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:16.460
Fall back to the middle guard and start chanting!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:18.630
Lady Daphne, push forward!

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:23.210
God of Strength, Bringer of Destruction,
I humbly beseech you...

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.080
I'm your opponent, lizard-brain!

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:35.790
It dove underwater again...

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:37.460
Lady Mikoto, activate your Skill!

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:39.710
Yata no Kurogarasu!

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:48.080
Lady Aisha, right beneath you!

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:51.750
Conquest of the Gods!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.920
Everyone in the vanguard, fall back now!

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:55.960
Get ready for the next attack!

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:58.630
Lady Mikoto, stretch it out as wide as you can!

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:00.460
Futsu no Mitama!

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:14.290
The Mist...!

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:16.420
Crap! Now, of all times?!

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:19.000
Go heavier, Lady Mikoto! And higher!

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:40.500
You did it, Lady Mikoto!

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:41.290
Bullseye!

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:43.460
Nice goin', you two!

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:45.170
Hiyo!

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:49.750
Let's waste this stupid snake!

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:56.250
Eat shit and die!

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.250
I DON'T THINK SO!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:15.170
Something's coming, you guys! Fall back!

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:22.580
Called up its buddies...

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.790
We just have to keep pushing through!

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.670
Don't let 'em get the best of you!

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:35.580
I don't understand how they can fight...

00:19:36.170 --> 00:19:37.880
Amidst all this despair...

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:41.080
The cage of despair has become a coffin...

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:44.040
This is where we'll meet our end.

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:46.540
We may wish it weren't true, but–

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:48.580
Ouch!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:49.960
You brainless healer!

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:50.380
Huh?!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.420
Hurry up and DO YOUR DAMN JOB!

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:55.080
D-Daphne...

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.420
We're out there battling a frickin' Floor Boss!

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:00.250
Meanwhile, our healer's too busy cowering in the corner!

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:03.420
I've got more important things
to do than babysit you, y'know!

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:07.960
How do you resist giving in to the despair...?

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:08.670
Huh?

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:14.330
No matter how much we struggle,
the despair will overtake us eventually.

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:15.750
I'm scared...

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:17.830
Too scared to fight back...

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:23.170
"Despair" this, "despair" that... You think I'm not scared?!

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:26.130
I'm scared as hell, but what choice do we have?!

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:32.250
Liliruca and the others took a stand, and
I wasn't ready to call it quits! That's why I chose to fight!

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.540
Daphne...

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:41.420
They've grown on you, too, haven't they?

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.290
In all their sappy, naïve glory...

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:49.880
So make yourself useful and help them!

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:53.000
Heal their wounds, protect them from harm!

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:55.210
Don't surrender to empty words like despair!

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:03.670
Look to the future! Meet it head-on!

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:06.500
'Cause you and me, we're adventurers!

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:11.630
Glow of Heaven, once rejected...

00:21:12.380 --> 00:21:15.460
Merciful arms that save this wretched self of mine...

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:20.750
My words stop just short;
go in their place to save my pitiful companions.

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:24.920
O, solar rays, I beseech you to ward off affliction.

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:27.580
Soul Light!

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:30.960
Wha–?

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:34.210
She's such a pain in the butt...

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:38.830
My injuries...

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:40.290
So she finally joined the party!

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:44.000
Sorry for not jumping in sooner. I'm ready to fight.

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:45.460
Lady Cassandra...

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:47.130
Well, it took you long enough!

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:50.330
We don't stand a chance without our two healers.

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:53.250
So from here on out,
I expect to see blood, sweat, and tears!

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:54.380
Roger!

